    "turn_idx": 21,
    "turn_text": "fact that you were such a strong defender of President Trump, while he was in office in relation to all of this Russia business, what has been your reaction in terms of what you've seen from the Durham investigation? And what do you think we're going to see next? Well, I guess, you know, I can remember you did a couple podcasts with you probably back in the 1718 timeframe. And I'm sure that Everything that I said on those podcasts at the time basically was true or we actually, they were much worse than we even thought they were. So it was pretty obvious from the beginning of all of this that this was a completely manufactured fake news narrative and it really is I think the gold standard or how to build a fake narrative 101 that left us with each when you go to left wing training school. And that's, you know, from the very beginning of this, a lot of people have said, oh, it's about You're just defending a Republican president, defending Trump. No, it's not that. I'm old enough to remember, and I know we discussed this years ago on your podcast, back in 15 and 16, I was pulling my hair out because I could not get the Obama Biden administration to do a damn thing about Russia. As Russia was essentially man-handling the United States all around the globe, just pushing us around. including in Syria, they took over Crimea, they were playing games in Libya. So you can imagine back in late 2016, right after the election, and Trump wins, we get a briefing, everything is normal, there's nothing new, this is nothing that the Russians, you know, the Russians are always meddling, not only in our election, but every election that they can mess with. And it's usually, you know, it's not really changing boats, it's just, it's just, you know, then positioning, right? You can even make an argument that most countries do this to some degree or another. And right after the election we were briefed and there was nothing going on that was out of the norm, and then in December. The fake news narrative start began in full. The Clinton campaign had dropped some nuggets out there. They didn't get a lot of takers. It was a lot of either has-bends or left-wing hacks that were writing about the Russia hoax back in June, July. It looked just like a deflect. the Hillary Clinton email scandal, which now we know that's exactly what was happening. But in December, December of 16, it went pro. The pros got involved. So essentially the Washington Post main hacks all got involved in the disinformation campaign. And so there was a, there were, there were leaks. They were getting leaks of classified information in December of 16. And then it just continued and it was all stuff that was hocus, pocus, Russians everywhere except Russians were nowhere. And they knew that the only place the Russians were, were involved in the Clinton campaign and they had to know it. And that's what Durham now has proven with these indictments. So where does Durham go from here? It looks like he's got the outlines of a massive conspiracy case. Conspiracy is hard to prove, but he's got the three big links. He's got somebody in the FBI who's already played guilty. He's indicted a Clinton lawyer and indicted the so-called source that was just a phony source of the dossier. But this whole idea, someone who's been doing this for a decade, and I guess at the time, you know, reading the intelligence reports, you know, I guess I had what six or seven years experience at that time. But when the when Buzzfeed produced the still dossier, I mean, no one that's ever read intelligence reports could have taken any of that seriously. And it would not have taken, it would have taken the FBI. a matter of hours to determine that that thing is completely fraudulent. So will Durham get these nasty dirty FBI DOJ officials? We don't know. It's going to be hard or they're just going to stick it on the Clinton campaign and their operatives and will they not be able to get beyond that? We don't know. But clearly, like I said at the outset, this is the gold plated or platinum plated 101 on how to be a left winger and how to use the media to develop a fake news narrative to put out propaganda. to really destroy the fabric of America and target your opposition political party, which are things that happen in places like Putin's Russia, the old Soviet Union, the Chinese Communist Party, any authoritarian dictatorship around the globe. That's what the Clinton campaign and the Democrats did and the Washington Post They went all their pollencers. They were the main bad actors in all of this because they were the paper of record. I mean, I think they're all total fake news and hacks, but they are the paper of record for our nation's capital and they were fully engaged in this taking leaks involved in criminal behavior. Multiple times, they knew they were involved in criminal behavior, all for something that they knew. At the same time, they were taking criminal leaks of what would be classified information. They knew underlying it that there was no embassy or consulate in Miami, Russian consulate. They knew there was no evidence of Donald Trump and prostitutes peeing on beds. They knew that Cohen wasn't in Prague. I mean, all stuff that would have just taken a second. There are minutes, hours for any FBI agent in any field office to just laugh at this because nobody could have ever taken this seriously. So where this goes, Dave, that's kind of my current thoughts on it. We'll see if Durham comes down with any more indictments, but I'd say there's",
