16. The good people, the people that focus on Russia knew that there was nothing out of the norm. What happened? It got politicized by deep state actors who took Clinton documentation and weaponize the intelligence agencies, the FBI, and the Department of Justice against us, against me. I've always viewed that. It's not Trump. It's not Carter Page. It's the conservative movement. It's the Republican Party that they weaponize. This happens in third world countries. And it's just now, I think the way I put it, David, it's just It's just completely spread. It's metastasized throughout the entire bureaucracy. And I think there's just a huge problem when you've got Washington, DC, the swamp that one political party, the Democratic Party gets 95% of the vote. And those bureaucracies get",
